# Greybox Top-Down Roguelike Art Bible

Generator credit: Greybox + Mira Designer. AI-assisted, human-directed.

## Pillars

- Every room has one readable tactical question.
- Rewards are visible before danger is fully solved.
- Boss-door pressure rises through narrower paths and higher contrast.

## Palette

- Dungeon Ink: #1A1A1F
- Floor Ash: #5C6166
- Torch Spark: #FF6B35
- Poison Green: #2ECC71
- Key Gold: #F4C95D
- Trap Red: #E94B3C
- Rune Cyan: #3CC2E0

## Materials

Prefer square silhouettes, bright item accents, and enemy materials that remain
readable over dark floor tiles at 70 percent zoom.
